Value LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value SYSTEM_NAME (\S+)
Value MGMT_IP (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)

Start
  ^Local Intf:\s+${LOCAL_INTERFACE}
  ^Chassis id:\s+${CHASSIS_ID}
  ^Port id:\s+${NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE}
  ^System Name:\s+${SYSTEM_NAME}
  ^\s+IP:\s+${MGMT_IP} -> Record
